Anchors here::here() to THIS directory rather than the monorepo's git root.

Without it, rprojroot walks up to /home/fguarda/Dev/Python/.git and every
here("data", ...) in R/0*.R resolves to a top-level data/ that does not exist.
has_file(".here") is rprojroot's highest-priority criterion, so this wins.

Do not delete. It is what makes the R scripts runnable from any working
directory, on either OS, with no absolute paths.
